  "story": {
    "title": "Fairy Rosy",
    "paragraphs_en": [
      "Once upon a time, there was a beautiful heaven.",
      "Little bit far, there was an ugly hell.",
      "In the heaven, there lived a beautiful castle.",
      "In the castle, there lived three family members. They were Fairies. They were the king, the queen and the young princess. The young princess name was Rosy.",
      "There was a bad witch with no name. She was a wicked witch.",
      "When Rosy turned five, her mother made a beautiful birthday cake.",
      "When she was about to blow the candles and cut the cake, an indoor thunder-storm came and destroyed the cake. The witch made the indoor thunder- storm and destroyed the cake. The witch was invisible. But Rosy killed the witch with her magic power and they lived happily ever after.",
      "THE MORAL OF THE STORY IS \"BE WISE AND BE BRAVE.\""
    ],
    "sentences": [
      {
        "text_en": "Once upon a time, there was a beautiful heaven.",
        "paragraph_index": 0,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_119972/s_000.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Ngày xửa ngày xưa, có một thiên đường rất đẹp."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Little bit far, there was an ugly hell.",
        "paragraph_index": 1,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_119972/s_001.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Xa một chút, có một địa ngục xấu xí."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "In the heaven, there lived a beautiful castle.",
        "paragraph_index": 2,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_119972/s_002.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Ở thiên đường đó, có một lâu đài xinh đẹp."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "In the castle, there lived three family members.",
        "paragraph_index": 3,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_119972/s_003.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Trong lâu đài, có ba thành viên trong gia đình."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "They were Fairies.",
        "paragraph_index": 3,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_119972/s_004.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Họ là những nàng Tiên."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "They were the king, the queen and the young princess.",
        "paragraph_index": 3,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_119972/s_005.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Đó là nhà vua, hoàng hậu và công chúa nhỏ."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "The young princess name was Rosy.",
        "paragraph_index": 3,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_119972/s_006.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Công chúa nhỏ tên là Rosy."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "There was a bad witch with no name.",
        "paragraph_index": 4,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_119972/s_007.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Có một mụ phù thủy xấu xa không có tên."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "She was a wicked witch.",
        "paragraph_index": 4,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_119972/s_008.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Bà ta là một mụ phù thủy độc ác."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "When Rosy turned five, her mother made a beautiful birthday cake.",
        "paragraph_index": 5,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_119972/s_009.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Khi Rosy tròn năm tuổi, mẹ cô bé đã làm một chiếc bánh sinh nhật thật đẹp."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "When she was about to blow the candles and cut the cake, an indoor thunder-storm came and destroyed the cake.",
        "paragraph_index": 6,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_119972/s_010.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Khi cô bé chuẩn bị thổi nến và cắt bánh, một cơn bão sấm sét trong nhà ập đến và phá hủy chiếc bánh."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "The witch made the indoor thunder- storm and destroyed the cake.",
        "paragraph_index": 6,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_119972/s_011.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Mụ phù thủy đã tạo ra cơn bão sấm sét đó và phá hủy chiếc bánh."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "The witch was invisible.",
        "paragraph_index": 6,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_119972/s_012.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Mụ phù thủy vô hình."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "But Rosy killed the witch with her magic power and they lived happily ever after.",
        "paragraph_index": 6,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_119972/s_013.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Nhưng Rosy đã giết mụ phù thủy bằng sức mạnh phép thuật của mình và họ sống hạnh phúc mãi mãi về sau."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "THE MORAL OF THE STORY IS \"BE WISE AND BE BRAVE.\"",
        "paragraph_index": 7,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_119972/s_014.mp3",
        "text_vi": "BÀI HỌC CỦA CÂU CHUYỆN LÀ \"HÃY KHÔN NGOAN VÀ DŨNG CẢM.\""
      }
    ]
  },
